@TaskBoard.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5243
@TaskId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### List tasks
GET {{TaskBoard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Accept: application/json

### Read a task (replace TaskId with an ID from the list or create response)
GET {{TaskBoard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/{{TaskId}}

### Create a task
POST {{TaskBoard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Try TaskBoard",
  "description": "Find the request in the Aspire dashboard.",
  "isCompleted": false
}

### Update and complete
PUT {{TaskBoard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/{{TaskId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Try TaskBoard",
  "description": "The trace is visible.",
  "isCompleted": true
}

### Delete a task (replace TaskId with disposable test data)
DELETE {{TaskBoard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/{{TaskId}}

### Development diagnostics
GET {{TaskBoard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/demo/slow?durationMs=1500

###
GET {{TaskBoard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/demo/fail
